<navigation-bar title="近7日奶量" back="{{false}}" color="#3d302a" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="milk-nav-back" bindtap="goBack" aria-role="button" aria-label="返回近7日报告"><view></view></view></navigation-bar>
<view class="milk-trend-page">
  <view wx:if="{{reviewLabel}}" class="milk-review">{{reviewLabel}}</view>
  <view class="milk-range-row"><text>{{rangeLabel}}</text><view id="milk-date-picker" class="milk-date-picker" bindtap="openCalendar" aria-role="button" aria-label="选择奶量统计截止日期">选择日期<view class="milk-date-chevron"></view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="milk-card milk-state">正在整理奶量记录…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{errorMessage}}" class="milk-card milk-state milk-error"><text>{{errorMessage}}</text><button class="milk-retry" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="milk-card milk-chart-card">
      <view class="milk-heading"><view class="milk-heading-icon"></view><text>近7日奶量</text></view>
      <view class="milk-stats"><view class="milk-stat"><view class="milk-stat-value"><text class="milk-stat-number {{totalLong ? 'long' : ''}}">{{totalText}}</text><text class="milk-unit">ml</text></view><text class="milk-stat-label">已知奶量总计</text></view><view class="milk-stat"><view class="milk-stat-value"><text class="milk-stat-number {{averageLong ? 'long' : ''}}">{{averageText}}</text><text class="milk-unit">ml / 日</text></view><text class="milk-stat-label">{{averageLabel}}</text></view></view>
      <view class="milk-chart {{wideAxis ? 'wide-axis' : ''}}">
        <view wx:if="{{knownDays}}" class="milk-axis"><view wx:for="{{axis}}" wx:key="key" class="milk-axis-label" style="bottom:{{item.bottom}}%"><text>{{item.text}}</text><view></view></view></view>
        <view class="milk-plot">
          <block wx:if="{{knownDays}}"><view wx:for="{{ticks}}" wx:key="key" class="milk-grid-line {{item.bottom === 100 ? 'milk-grid-top' : ''}}" style="bottom:{{item.bottom}}%"></view></block>
          <view wx:else class="milk-chart-empty">暂无已知奶量</view>
          <view class="milk-columns"><view wx:for="{{bars}}" wx:key="date" id="milk-day-{{index}}" class="milk-column {{item.date === selectedDate ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-date="{{item.date}}" bindtap="selectDay" aria-role="button" aria-label="{{item.date}} {{item.known ? item.valueText + '毫升' : '无已知奶量'}}"><view wx:if="{{item.known}}" class="milk-bar" style="height:{{item.height}}%"></view><text wx:else class="milk-no-value">—</text><text class="milk-date-label">{{item.label}}</text></view></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="milk-card milk-records-card"><view class="milk-records-heading"><text>{{selectedDateLabel}}</text><text class="milk-feed-count">{{selectedCount}}次喂养</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{detailUnavailable}}" class="milk-empty">这份历史日报未保存逐次奶量明细，不能用当前记录替代。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{!detailUnavailable && records.length === 0}}" class="milk-empty">这一天没有奶量记录。</view>
      <view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="milkRecordId" class="milk-feed-row" data-id="{{item.milkRecordId}}" bindtap="openRecord" aria-role="button" aria-label="查看{{item.typeLabel}}喂养记录"><view class="milk-feed-icon"></view><view class="milk-feed-copy"><text class="milk-feed-type">{{item.typeLabel}}</text><text class="milk-feed-volume">{{item.volumeText}}</text></view><text class="milk-feed-time">{{item.time}}</text><view class="milk-feed-chevron"></view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="milk-disclosure"><view id="milk-info-toggle" class="milk-disclosure-heading" bindtap="toggleInfo" aria-role="button" aria-expanded="{{showInfo}}"><text>记录说明</text><text>{{showInfo ? '−' : '+'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{showInfo}}" class="milk-disclosure-body"><text>总量仅汇总已记录且明确体积的奶量，不代表全天实际摄入。{{knownDays ? '日均按' + knownDays + '天有量记录计算，未记录日不当作0。' : '没有已知奶量，日均保持未知。'}}未知体积仅计次数{{unknownCount ? '，本周期共' + unknownCount + '次' : ''}}。已绑定且基准可核的奶量按资料参与营养统计，历史报告保留原计算版本。</text><text>点击柱或日期查看当天逐次记录，点击记录可修改该次喂养。数值以整数显示，用户接受的估算性质及原始精度保留；查看历史报告使用其保存的记录快照。</text></view></view>
  </block>
</view>

<date-calendar id="date-selector" visible="{{showCalendar}}" selected="{{endDate || today}}" max-date="{{today}}" title="选择近7日截至日期" bindchange="changeDate" bindclose="closeCalendar"/>
